  "body": "Presumably as a result of https://github.com/whatwg/html/commit/76a4fc2655799bb50bfcb1ea0039ccf94384187e\n\nFor example, https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/#change-the-encoding is not working.\n\nIt would be good to confirm whether this ever worked, as I can't see where the code changed in a way that would lose information. But I am pretty sure it did; my impression was that all the IDs in the document used to redirect appropriately, whereas now this one and at least one other I ran into but forgot are broken.\n",
